; This adapter only ever uses Modbus TCP (ModbusRTU#connectTCP), never RTU/serial.
; modbus-serial lists "serialport" as an optional dependency purely for RTU support
; and already guards its require() in try/catch - omitting it avoids a native-module
; build entirely (a plausible source of platform-specific CI flakiness, e.g. on
; macOS runners) without affecting anything this adapter actually uses.
omit=optional
